flowchart TB
  EXT[外部 Agent / IDE / CLI / Workflow] --> ADP[MCP / API / CLI / IDE Adapters]
  ADP --> U[用户意图 / 工程任务]
  U --> R0[R0 意图识别]
  R0 --> KR[建木知识网按需路由]

  subgraph K[建木知识网思考链]
    K1[基本概念]
    K2[一级联想]
    K3[抽象层]
    K4[规律层]
    K5[工具层]
    K6[表达层]
    K7[工程约束]
    K8[质量门]
    K9[返修规则]
    K1 --> K2 --> K3 --> K4 --> K5 --> K6 --> K7 --> K8 --> K9
  end

  KR --> K1
  K9 --> FE[FAME 路由状态层]

  subgraph F[FAMEEdgeState]
    F1[mu 有效正反馈]
    F2[chi 探索价值]
    F3[epsilon 目标贴合]
    F4[kappa 置信度]
    F5[nu 风险不确定]
    F6[delta 逻辑冲突]
    F7[rho 资源压力]
    F8[lambda 失败教训]
    F9[xi 惯性]
    F10[freshness 时效]
  end

  FE --> F1
  FE --> F2
  FE --> F3
  FE --> F4
  FE --> F5
  FE --> F6
  FE --> F7
  FE --> F8
  FE --> F9
  FE --> F10

  subgraph P[工程现场图谱]
    P1[文件 / 模块 / 函数]
    P2[任务 / 阶段 / 进度]
    P3[工具调用 / MCP]
    P4[测试 / 构建 / 运行]
    P5[失败 / 冲突 / 修复]
    P6[manifest / artifact]
    P7[日志 / 摘要]
  end

  subgraph PM[Project Memory Graph 项目工程记忆 Overlay]
    PM1[project_manifest]
    PM2[project_graph]
    PM3[fame_overlay]
    PM4[tool_invocation_summary]
    PM5[failure_lessons]
    PM6[context_summaries]
    PM7[promotion_candidates]
  end

  P --> PM
  PM --> FE
  PM --> S
  FE --> S[路线评分与上下文裁剪]
  S --> GG[GoalGate 找球门]
  GG --> GP[GoalPath scoped beam traversal]
  GP --> G{权限 / 质量门 / 风险}
  G -->|通过| M[按需读取工具说明书]
  M --> EK[Enforcement Kernel 强制检查]
  EK --> AA[签发 ApprovedAction]
  AA --> T[一次性工具编排与执行]
  G -->|不通过| H[人工确认 / 降级 / 返修]
  T --> O[执行结果]
  H --> O
  O --> Q[review / quality gate]
  Q --> L[日志与摘要写回]
  L --> P
  L --> PM
  L --> FE
  L --> C[上下文释放：只保留摘要和可检索索引]
  L --> CLK[Agent 时钟 / 提醒 / 自我迭代]
  CLK --> KR
  CLK --> P
  L --> WB[Knowledge Workbench 可视化与补充入口]
  WB --> KP[KnowledgePatchProposal / Review]
  WB --> PMV[Project Memory View]
  PMV --> PM
  PM7 --> KP
  WB --> TD[Traversal Debug / 剪枝原因]
  TD --> GG
  KP --> KR
  KP --> FE

  subgraph D[模块化调试接口]
    D1[health]
    D2[explain]
    D3[dry-run]
    D4[replay]
    D5[metrics]
  end
  KR --> D
  FE --> D
  EK --> D
